        "action": "Tax kerosene used by private jets",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "We believe kerosene should be taxed for private jets in the UK. Private jet usage contributes much higher carbon per passenger than conventional commercial air travel and therefore should be taxed accordingly. Private jet travel is a luxury that causes environmental damage.",
